#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:3
#: e7b96772324341719bfd0a405394dccf
msgid "**ARCHIVED**"
msgstr "**已归档**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:7
#: 19ad2896b8d34d1ea8f58a33644861e7
msgid "DROTAG x for Geotagging"
msgstr "DROTAG x 地理标记"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:13
#: 7cd567f480e74344ae600e84fcee4cb8
msgid ""
"`DROTAGx <https://www.airborneprojects.com/product/drotag-onboard-image-"
"tagging-computer/>`__ makes geo-tagging easy by recording the vehicle's "
"position directly into the images on the camera."
msgstr ""
"`DROTAGx <https://www.airborneprojects.com/product/drotag-onboard-image-"
"tagging-computer/>`__ 通过将飞行器位置直接记录到相机中的图像，使地理标记变得简便。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:15
#: 551394f3c6fd441c892522122fac81f5
msgid ""
"Images are geotagged with the vehicle's Latitude, Longitude and Altitude "
"(above sea level) at the moment the photo was taken.  These value can be "
"viewed with any EXIF viewer"
msgstr "图像在拍照时标记了飞行器的纬度、经度和高度（海拔）。这些值可以用任何 EXIF 查看器查看"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:16
#: 24698583026b481dbb22799e9585ac5d
msgid ""
"Two text files are also created which include the image name, lat, lon, alt "
"above home, altitude above sea level, roll, pitch and yaw"
msgstr "还会创建两个文本文件，包含图像名称、纬度、经度、相对 Home 高度、海拔高度、横滚、俯仰和偏航"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:17
#: 36bfed95813740fe8be8988b6d0bcfa8
msgid "Captures picture every 1.6 seconds"
msgstr "每 1.6 秒拍摄一张照片"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:18
#: c9f66830a1104c699e9fc0afebb89714
msgid ""
"Includes a Hotshoe which connects between the autopilot and your camera's "
"flash to improve the accuracy of the geo-tagging"
msgstr "包含热靴，连接在飞控和相机闪光灯之间，以提高地理标记的精度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:20
#: 0ef0c7c86fd94a5995421a871698db7e
msgid ""
"More details can be found in the official DrotagX manual (`web "
"<https://www.airborneprojects.com/doc/drotagx/>`__, `pdf "
"<https://www.airborneprojects.com/docs/drotagx_manual.pdf>`__) including "
"pre-flight checklists, detailed explanations for diagnosis and other tips."
msgstr ""
"更多详情请参阅官方 DrotagX 手册（`网页 "
"<https://www.airborneprojects.com/doc/drotagx/>`__，`PDF "
"<https://www.airborneprojects.com/docs/drotagx_manual.pdf>`__），包括飞行前检查清单、详细诊断说明和其他提示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:23
#: 3e101f0d5afb401cb82128d68c4e6c5f
msgid "Setup, Configuration"
msgstr "设置与配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:25
#: 1a3096d5a5354a7fb75b0a09ffa4cbe5
msgid ""
"Connect the Drotag's 6-pin JST connector to one of the autopilot's serial "
"ports"
msgstr "将 Drotag 的 6 针 JST 连接器连接到飞控的一个串口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:26
#: af90b554e0f74ff4a85eb82207364c8b
msgid "Connect the micro USB connector to the Sony camera's \"MultiPort\""
msgstr "将 Micro USB 连接器连接到 Sony 相机的「MultiPort」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:27
#: d1a7e6df3cdf4e4d9dc313f20f3d5800
msgid ""
"Set the following parameters in ArduPilot (assuming the Drotag is connect to"
" Serial port 1) and then reboot the autopilot"
msgstr "在 ArduPilot 中设置以下参数（假设 Drotag 连接到串口 1），然后重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:29
#: 42e0c28aea34410ebfb1be1aeac46536
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL1_BAUD<SERIAL1_BAUD>`: 115"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL1_BAUD<SERIAL1_BAUD>`：115"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:30
#: 169790216aee487596fe2dd4028d9c9d
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>`: 1"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>`：1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:32
#: 9622b30170fa4ddf8b875a29489f2b7b
msgid "Turn on the camera"
msgstr "打开相机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:33
#: cb0aa049ec1347e095345a052e237a19
msgid "Power the autopilot and Drotag"
msgstr "给飞控和 Drotag 上电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:34
#: 0823d10987eb4b04a74b2eb9c4c27378
msgid "If all goes well the following will happen:"
msgstr "如果一切正常，将发生以下情况："

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:36
#: e9bdeccbaf094ed692c9e90a7e15f6bd
msgid "Drotag's red LED should blink twice quickly about once per second"
msgstr "Drotag 的红色 LED 应每秒快速闪烁两次"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:37
#: 53d3b7d9c36c43c1a43fbb91e1d95128
msgid ""
"The camera should switch to \"mass storage\" for about 30 seconds (or less) "
"and then return to regular shooting mode"
msgstr "相机应切换到「大容量存储」模式约 30 秒（或更短），然后返回正常拍摄模式"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:38
#: 2098ede0a722425491bbfb6e1b862173
msgid ""
"If a MAVLink Inspector is used (available in MissionPlanner and QGC) a "
"\"Component 2\" should appear and send heartbeats once every 3 seconds"
msgstr ""
"如果使用 MAVLink 检查器（在 Mission Planner 和 QGC 中可用），应出现「Component 2」并每 3 秒发送一次心跳"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:45
#: a6b17cde05f94c569d14630561f19c7e
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:47
#: cc6db1664e70422187055ba7f6390513
msgid "Test the Drotag is working correctly by doing the following"
msgstr "通过以下步骤测试 Drotag 是否正常工作"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:49
#: 36f6efa3581044d79f190ebbeaa1018b
msgid ""
"Connect with Mission Planner and right-mouse-button-clicking on the map and "
"select, \"Trigger Camera Now\".  The camera should emit a click as it takes "
"a picture.  Normally a green circle will also appear on the map."
msgstr "连接 Mission Planner，在地图上右键单击并选择「立即触发相机」。相机应发出咔哒声表示拍照。通常地图上也会出现绿色圆圈。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:50
#: 56b210c4014e4d34b294c1965ece189f
msgid ""
"Arm the vehicle, trigger another picture, then disarm the vehicle.  The "
"camera should momentarily switch to \"Mass Storage\" mode as Drotag geotags "
"the images and writes the text files"
msgstr "解锁飞行器，触发另一张照片，然后上锁飞行器。相机应短暂切换到「大容量存储」模式，因为 Drotag 正在对图像进行地理标记并写入文本文件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:57
#: 09f27c56619041c091f7ac854b6093c3
msgid "Retrieving Geotagged Images"
msgstr "获取地理标记图像"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:59
#: 48d963aa81bb4d86bd821e4c533b208e
msgid ""
"Drotag writes the location information directly into the .jpg images files "
"using EXIF and also into two accompanying files on the camera's SD card"
msgstr "Drotag 使用 EXIF 将位置信息直接写入 .jpg 图像文件，同时写入相机 SD 卡上的两个附加文件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:61
#: cd881b83d4cc4297885252b30f6dc87c
msgid ""
"Connect the camera's USB port to your PC or remove the SD card and download "
"to your PC"
msgstr "将相机 USB 端口连接到 PC 或取出 SD 卡下载到 PC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:62
#: df0a647d6685407d95e8bf54f156444d
msgid ""
"The location can be viewed with any EXIF viewer including Window's file "
"property viewer"
msgstr "位置可以用任何 EXIF 查看器查看，包括 Windows 文件属性查看器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:68
#: 2c3693d5adac48dfbb983eecacf652e2
msgid ""
"The PIX4D_xxxx.txt includes the image's lat, lon, alt, roll, pitch and yaw "
"information as shown below"
msgstr "PIX4D_xxxx.txt 包含图像的纬度、经度、高度、横滚、俯仰和偏航信息，如下所示"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:74
#: 9b55f69270a24ef5ab5ba39958fc04bb
msgid "The tagging_xxxx.log file has the following information"
msgstr "tagging_xxxx.log 文件包含以下信息"
